# examples/.gitignore
#
# ALLOWLIST. Everything here is ignored by default; only the generic example
# orchestrations shipped with sammy-pack are un-ignored below. Domain-specific
# orchestrations (imported per consumer app) are excluded automatically so a
# stray `git add -A` cannot commit them to the public repo.
# To ship a NEW generic example, add an explicit `!name.json`.

*
